OL,3,GNEWSAPC guilty of sexually assaulting
OL,4,Awoman after party
OL,5,
OL,6,FA West Yorkshire Police officer has
OL,7,Fbeen convicted of sexually assaulting a
OL,8,Fwoman after a party.
OL,10,FJack Blagbrough, 32, assaulted the
OL,11,Fwoman at a house in the Bradford area
OL,12,Fon 23 August 2024.
OL,14,FHe was found guilty after a trial at
OL,15,FSheffield Crown Court and will be
OL,16,Fsentenced on 15 December.
OL,18,FThe serving Kirklees officer will also
OL,19,Fface disciplinary proceedings, West
OL,20,FYorkshire Police said.
